<h2>State-of-the-Art on LongBench and InfiniteBench</h2>
<p>Quality doesn't trade off against speed. On both LongBench (2K–32K) and InfiniteBench (up to 128K), Prefilling-dLLM achieves the best average score among all dLLM acceleration methods — in some cases beating the un-accelerated vanilla model.</p>

